      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WENTWORTH FLYER (2) flew the lids with a slick early split last time and went on to clock 22.79 as a strongly fancied winner over 400m at this track. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Ideally placed to take this out. IBROX REIGN (1) rocketed out of the inside draw with a strong early sectional and gave a sight but had to settle for a placing, finishing second (22.59) at Gosford over 388m. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Expected to feature again. PRECIOUS WONDER (3) looks close to another win after finishing third from Box 4 last time (23.11) at Maitland. Winning chance. NAN SAID NO (4) is one of the chances after a surprise minor prize last time.",
